  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_typ\": \"CEFR English Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nIn the world of technology, virtual reality (VR) has emerged as a game-changer. It promises to revolutionize various industries by providing immersive experiences that can simulate real-world scenarios or transport users into entirely new environments. VR technology has been around for decades, but it was only recently that advancements in hardware and software have made it more accessible to the general public.\\\\\nThe potential applications of VR are vast. In education, students can virtually travel to historical sites or explore complex scientific concepts in a way that's more engaging than reading about them in textbooks. The healthcare industry is also benefiting from VR, with therapies using virtual reality to help patients overcome phobias or rehabilitate after injuries.\\\\\nHowever, like any emerging technology, VR faces challenges. The cost of equipment can be a barrier for many potential users, and there are concerns about the impact on mental health due to excessive use or virtual environments that may cause disorientation or anxiety.\\\\\nDespite these issues, VR's potential for transforming industries and enhancing human experiences remains significant. As research continues to uncover new applications and solutions to challenges, we can anticipate further growth in this field.\"\n},\n\"questions\": [\n  {\n    \"question_number\": 36,\n    \"question\": \"What is the main topic of this passage?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      \"The history of technology\",\n      \"Virtual reality's impact on mental health\",\n      \"Advancements in VR hardware and software\",\n      \"The future of education\"\n    ],\n    \"answer\": \"Advancements in VR hardware and software\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"question_number\": 37,\n    \"question\": \"How does virtual reality enhance educational experiences?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      \"By providing interactive lessons\",\n      \"Through simulation of real-world scenarios\",\n      \"Using virtual environments to teach complex concepts\",\n      \"Bringing historical events to life\"\n    ],\n    \"answer\": \"Through simulation of real-world scenarios\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"question_number\": 38,\n    \"question\": \"Which industry is NOT mentioned as benefiting from VR?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      \"Healthcare\",\n      \"Education\",\n      \"Gaming\",\n      \"Agriculture\"\n    ],\n    \"answer\": \"Agriculture\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"question_number\": 39,\n    \"question\": \"What is a potential challenge faced by VR users?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      \"High cost of equipment\",\n      \"Impact on mental health due to excessive use\",\n      \"Limited accessibility in developing countries\",\n      \"Insufficient software applications\"\n    ],\n    \"answer\": \"Impact on mental health due to excessive use\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"question_number\": 40,\n    \"question\": \"What is the author's tone towards virtual reality?\",\n    \"options\": [\n      \"Optimistic\",\n      \"Doubtful\",\n      \"Neutral\",\n      \"Critical\"\n    ],\n    \"answer\": \"Optimistic\"\n  }\n]\n}",
